<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 30/JULY 1.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 30/JULY 1.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Tuesday, July 1, on Monday. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   01.07.97	  30.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.6504	    6.6620</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3017	    2.3173</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5120	    4.5482</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.5008	    3.5042</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5188	    0.5203</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7717	    0.7764</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2875	    0.2897</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0022	    7.0194</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6930	    0.6938</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2223	    1.2255</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
